 "changed_since_previous": "Added release notes in doc/release-notes-35728.md detailing the changed error behavior for getrawtransaction, gettxoutproof, utxoupdatepsbt, descriptorprocesspsbt, and /rest/tx/.",
 "card": "TxIndex and node::GetTransaction now throw std::runtime_error on disk I/O, deserialization, and index corruption failures rather than returning null. Currently, disk read errors or txindex corruption lead RPC and REST callers to report confirmed transactions as missing, concealing disk failure or corruption. This change causes endpoints such as getrawtransaction, gettxoutproof, PSBT processors, and /rest/tx/ to return internal errors instead of false 'not found' responses, while distinguishing pruned or downloading blocks with CheckBlockDataAvailability.",
